":c:type:`PyBytesWriter` API。 （由 Victor Stinner 在 :gh:`129813` 中贡献。）.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:2650
msgid ""
":c:func:`!_PyObject_CallMethodId`, :c:func:`!_PyObject_GetAttrId` and "
":c:func:`!_PyUnicode_FromId` are deprecated since 3.15 and will be removed "
"in 3.20. Instead, use :c:func:`PyUnicode_InternFromString()` and cache the "
"result in the module state, then call :c:func:`PyObject_CallMethod` or "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetAttr`. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`141049`.)"
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!_PyObject_CallMethodId`, :c:func:`!_PyObject_GetAttrId` 和 "
":c:func:`!_PyUnicode_FromId` 自 3.15 起已弃用并将在 3.20 中移除。 作为替代，请使用 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_InternFromString()` 并将结果缓存在模块状态中，然后调用 "
":c:func:`PyObject_CallMethod` 或 :c:func:`PyObject_GetAttr`。 （由 Victor "
"Stinner 在 :gh:`141049` 中贡献。）"

